A Dark Room — M5PaperS3 port
============================

This firmware (src/adarkroom/) is an unofficial community PORT / homage of the
game "A Dark Room" to the M5PaperS3 e-ink card. It is not affiliated with,
endorsed by, or produced by the original authors.

